trait-name-Unstable = Unstable
trait-description-Unstable = You've spent too long in the wastes, or maybe used too many drugs, but now you see things that aren't really there. Every 5-20 minutes there is an 80% chance of imagined enemies or a brief private weather effect. Enemy attacks cause no bleeding or permanent wounds, but can briefly make you collapse before you recover. Clearing the enemies removes their perceived damage, and hunger and thirst separately make food or drinks appear that vanish when touched, each on its own ten-minute cooldown. Only you can see or hear them.

trait-name-ClearHeaded = Clear-Headed
trait-description-ClearHeaded = Drugs cannot make you hallucinate or cause you to develop Unstable.
